ents": [{"id": "1867b4b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "05", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d205c16", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Formuláře", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "655be11", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Ověřujeme, že poptávky z webu skutečně dorazí.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "eec51f4", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "00ac0c1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "06", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5953870", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "SEO", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c340428", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Sledujeme Search Console a opravujeme chyby indexace.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "8a9a963", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "39a5084", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "07", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a5f8cc5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cookies a GDPR", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b1818c3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Lišta a dokumenty v souladu s aktuálními pravidly.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "33d973a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d3e17c6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "08", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2975919", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Rozvoj", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6622a97", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Návrhy na vylepšení podle návštěvnosti a poptávek.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "b6fa46f", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "detail"}, "elements": [{"id": "df32418", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-legal-wrap ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f6ff6ec", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Proč nesvěřit správu webu náhodě", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b1f79d9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Neaktualizovaný WordPress je častým cílem útoků. Nefunkční formulář znamená ztracené poptávky, o kterých nevíte. A zastaralý obsah odrazuje zákazníky. Pravidelná správa webu těmto problémům předchází.</p><h3>Propagace a kampaně</h3><p>Se správou webu umíme navázat i propagací: PPC kampaně, sociální sítě a <a href=\"/seo-optimalizace-webu/\">SEO optimalizace</a> zajišťuje tým agentury Yesmark.</p><h3>Převezmeme i cizí web</h3><p>Máte web od jiného dodavatele, který už nereaguje? Web projdeme, zazálohujeme a převezmeme. Pokud je zastaralý, navrhneme <a href=\"/redesign-webu/\">redesign webu</a>.</p><h3>Kolik stojí správa webu</h3><p>Cena správy webu závisí na velikosti webu a rozsahu úprav. Nabízíme pravidelnou měsíční správu i jednorázové zásahy podle potřeby.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-legaltext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "48e6931", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "reference"}, "elements": [{"id": "e666730", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ec8e155", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "eee3efe", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "787ef61", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Reference", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e335adb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Weby, na které jsme hrdí.", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "7b71d17", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Výběr realizací. Celé portfolio webů, e-shopů a kampaní najdete na Yesmark.eu.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "085b465", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-refs", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ee4429a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "fd601f2", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7fc353c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 28, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Konradt", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e3f6f3d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "305a904", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6412650", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · CNC obrábění", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "13ddb58", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Konradt", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1b37488", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro společnost KONRADT jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na profesionální prezentaci služeb v oblasti CNC obrábění, montáže a zpracování kovů. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní technický vzhled, přehledné představení výrobních možností společnosti a srozumitelnou prezentaci jednotlivých služeb.</p><p>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6d8b954", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "6e45659", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "1737c38", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6817f8a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6dad796", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "5662cf9", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "5cd0051", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b54808a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "96b644f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "793e46e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "35b077b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "33eeb0c", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "791c755", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c8daf78", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "64299f0", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "0b069b4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e2a2112", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Břinčil", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b29fc5d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Při realizaci webu pro firmu Břinčil jsme kladli důraz na moderní a přehledný design, snadnou orientaci návštěvníků a kvalitní prezentaci společnosti i její techniky. Nový web zároveň slouží jako p